OL,3,GNEWSALeadership key in chief minister
OL,4,Avote, says Chamber
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Isle of Man's new MHKs should
OL,7,Fchoose a chief minister based on
OL,8,Fleadership qualities, rather than
OL,9,Fexperience or popularity, the Chamber
OL,10,Fof Commerce has said.
OL,12,FThe business lobby group has issued
OL,13,Fadvice to the new administration, which
OL,14,Fhas 15 newcomers out of 24 members.
OL,16,FThe members will vote for the next
OL,17,Fchief minister at the next Tynwald
OL,18,Fsitting on 13 October.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
