OL,3,GNEWSALeadership key in chief minister
OL,4,Avote, says Chamber
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Chamber of Commerce president,
OL,7,FClaire Watterson, said the next chief
OL,8,Fminister would need to unite the new
OL,9,Fmembers into a "cohesive" team.
